      "strings": {
        "brief": "You're on an authorised exercise at Quayholt Insurance, a fictional company. You're on the IT service desk in Leila Nassar's seat. Four calls are waiting and a sign-in prompt from overnight is still on your phone. Some callers are who they say, and some are reading facts they found online. Help the real ones, and ring back or escalate anything that doesn't sit right. Ringing back a real caller never costs you anything.",
